    <a class="wordmark" href="/">Calan</a>
    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
  </header>
  <main class="shell">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <article class="legal-content">
      <p>Last updated September 26, 2026</p>

      <h2>Website use</h2>
      <p>
        This website provides information about Calan, a product currently in development. You may use the
        website for lawful, personal purposes. Do not interfere with its operation or attempt to misuse its forms.
      </p>

      <h2>Waitlist</h2>
      <p>
        Joining the waitlist expresses interest in Calan but does not guarantee access, a release date, or any
        particular product functionality. We may contact you with product and early-access updates. You can
        unsubscribe at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Product information</h2>
      <p>
        Calan is evolving. Examples on this website illustrate the intended experience and may not represent
        final features. We may change or discontinue any part of the website or planned product without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The Calan name, website content, design, and related materials belong to their respective owner and may
        not be copied or used commercially without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
